<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Golf-Woods finishes four shots behind Parsons.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Golf-Woods finishes four shots behind Parsons.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>American Tiger Woods has finished four shots off the pace on five under par 68 at the Australian Masters golf tournament at Huntingdale.</p>
<p>Australian Lucas Parsons equalled the course record with a first round 64, nine under par, to hold the lead late in the day, one shot clear of compatriot Peter O'Mally.</p>
